<title>USA: Comair in $330 mln Canadair deal.</title>
<headline>Comair in $330 mln Canadair deal.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comair Inc said Friday that it has signed an agreement for a firm order for 18 Canadair Jet aircraft, valued at $330 million.</p>
<p>The 50-seat Canadair Regional Jet is manufactured by Bombardier Inc.</p>
<p>The agreement includes conditional orders for 12 jets and options for 45 additional jet aircraft, for a total of up to 75 aircraft.</p>
<p>If exercised, some of the options could be converted to Canadair's 70-seat jet, which was introduced earlier this year.</p>
</text>
